WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.677 --> 00:00:15.118
lake began to bubble and churn.

2
00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:17.519
Waves splashed onto the shore.

3
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.100
A giant figure rose out of the water.

4
00:00:23.961 --> 00:00:27.983
"Whoa!" said Roxy, looking down.

5
00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:30.004
"I'm huge!"

6
00:00:33.584 --> 00:00:36.206
Downtown, Roxy slowly walked between the buildings.

7
00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:41.390
"Be careful," she told herself.

8
00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:44.193
"You don't want to step on anybody!"

9
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.782
Roxy saw a frog clinging to Metro City Bank.

10
00:00:56.743 --> 00:00:58.244
The frog was slimy and gross.

11
00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.126
But now Roxy was much bigger than it.

12
00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:03.248
Roxy took a deep breath.

13
00:01:04.424 --> 00:01:06.525
"Okay. I can do this.

14
00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:08.526
I can pick up a frog."

15
00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.728
She closed her eyes and reached for the frog.

16
00:01:12.649 --> 00:01:13.789
Roxy felt it squish.

17
00:01:13.809 --> 00:01:17.952
"Eww!" she cried, quickly pulling her hand back.

18
00:01:18.952 --> 00:01:20.073
Roxy reached out again.

19
00:01:20.973 --> 00:01:23.915
This time she gently picked the slimy creature off the building.

20
00:01:25.196 --> 00:01:28.218
Holding the frog in her hand, Roxy zoomed back to the park.

21
00:01:29.158 --> 00:01:30.899
She dropped the frog into the purple lake.

22
00:01:31.679 --> 00:01:36.005
Splash! "That wasn't so bad," thought Roxy.

23
00:01:37.366 --> 00:01:39.427
Roxy flew back to downtown Metro City.

24
00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:42.869
One by one, she found all the frogs.

25
00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:45.730
She put all of them in the lake.

26
00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:49.592
"Whew!" said Roxy.

27
00:01:49.612 --> 00:01:51.493
"I'm glad that's done.

28
00:01:52.414 --> 00:01:54.215
But the frogs are still too big.

29
00:01:55.135 --> 00:01:56.036
And so am I.

30
00:01:56.856 --> 00:01:58.597
What made us grow in the first place?"

31
00:01:59.898 --> 00:02:01.119
Roxy thought for a moment.

32
00:02:01.919 --> 00:02:03.220
She looked down at the purple lake.

33
00:02:04.248 --> 00:02:05.429
"Aha!" she said.

34
00:02:05.449 --> 00:02:06.910
"The meteor!"

35
00:02:12.874 --> 00:02:15.396
Roxy stepped into the lake and fished around under the water.

36
00:02:16.917 --> 00:02:18.598
A moment later she felt the meteor.

37
00:02:19.499 --> 00:02:20.839
Roxy pulled it out of the lake.

38
00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.322
Right away the water lost its purple color.

39
00:02:25.603 --> 00:02:27.344
Roxy flung the meteor into the sky.

40
00:02:31.916 --> 00:02:35.418
The purple rock disappeared as it soared through space, far from Earth.

41
00:02:36.799 --> 00:02:38.420
Roxy started to feel strange again.

42
00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:40.341
"I'm shrinking!"

43
00:02:40.621 --> 00:02:41.281
Roxy thought.

44
00:02:41.301 --> 00:02:50.666
"And so are the Roxy's friends were coming out of the woods.

45
00:02:52.047 --> 00:02:53.048
They stood near the lake.

46
00:02:53.068 --> 00:02:57.350
"I wonder where Roxy went," said Terrell.

47
00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:00.592
"Maybe she went home," said Jack.

48
00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:03.802
"She was really scared of the giant frog."

49
00:03:04.863 --> 00:03:06.704
Mara saw a frog hop out of the lake.

50
00:03:07.945 --> 00:03:08.685
She reached down.

51
00:03:08.705 --> 00:03:10.927
"Look!" she said.

52
00:03:10.947 --> 00:03:14.790
"Here's another frog—a normal-sized one."

53
00:03:16.111 --> 00:03:17.392
Just then Roxy appeared.

54
00:03:17.412 --> 00:03:20.274
"Hi everyone," she said.

55
00:03:20.294 --> 00:03:21.735
"I'm back.

56
00:03:22.215 --> 00:03:24.397
That giant frog sure was scary, right?"

57
00:03:25.537 --> 00:03:26.438
She looked at Mara.

58
00:03:26.458 --> 00:03:28.880
"Ooh! Can I hold that frog?"

59
00:03:30.016 --> 00:03:32.959
"I thought you were scared of frogs," said Mara.

60
00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.361
She handed the frog to Roxy.

61
00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:38.263
"Not anymore," said Roxy.

62
00:03:39.204 --> 00:03:41.286
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

63
00:03:42.247 --> 00:03:43.608
But he didn't say anything.
